INFO 2026-04-18 02:52:23,954 accounts.api_io [request_id=27830874-B93C-40A3-98E7-45BE0338907B] HTTP 请求进入: POST /api/v1/ai/chat/sync/push/ headers={"Host": "localhost:8000", "Content-Type": "application/json", "Accept-Encoding": "gzip, deflate", "User-Agent": "SparkClient/1 CFNetwork/3860.300.31 Darwin/25.3.0", "Connection": "keep-alive", "Accept": "*/*", "Accept-Language": "zh-CN,zh-Hans;q=0.9", "Authorization": "Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJ0b2tlbl90eXBlIjoiYWNjZXNzIiwiZXhwIjoxNzc2NDgyMjUxLCJpYXQiOjE3NzY0ODA0NTEsImp0aSI6Ijg2NDhiMmVlNWRhNjQ3NTA4ZGJjNGY4NzA5NzM5MTVmIiwidXNlcl9pZCI6IjYifQ.Mbzkfwfdxho0BZ5W8N6ZLuoUpGF1oYfGyteV2NPmgrc", "X-Request-Id": "27830874-B93C-40A3-98E7-45BE0338907B", "Content-Length": "1883"} body={"messages": [{"created_at": "2026-04-18T02:52:14.967Z", "content": "哈哈哈", "attachments": [], "role": "user", "kind": "text", "thread_id": "F3F4ED0A-FAFE-43CC-866F-F6A9140FB749", "client_message_id": "FF611E57-2916-415B-B905-C59945A7335C", "tombstone": false, "reasoning_expanded": false, "delivery_state": "pending", "reasoning_visibility": "full"}, {"created_at": "2026-04-18T02:52:23.939Z", "content": "这份是50岁女性的甲状腺功能三项检验报告，结果解读如下：\n1. **游离三碘甲状腺原氨酸（F13）**：4.97Pmol/l，在参考区间3.1-6.8Pmol/l内，结果正常\n2. **游离甲状腺素（FT4）**：15.23pmol/L，在参考区间12-22pmol/L内，结果正常\n3. **促甲状腺激素（ISH）**：5.19WIU/ml，高于参考区间0.27-4.2WIU/ml，结果异常升高\n\n异常结果提示可能存在亚临床甲状腺功能减退，结合报告中“水肿”的临床诊断，符合甲减的常见表现，建议您携报告至内分泌科就诊，由医生结合临床情况评估是否需要干预治疗。\n\n请问我帮您将这份报告生成结构化的检验报告健康卡片保存吗？", "attachments": [{"id": "CB005B1C-A6D7-45F2-B709-D2DF557D5417", "type": "toolName", "text": "get_current_member"}, {"id": "4CB13811-685C-4F90-8C6D-4D509E500969", "type": "toolContent", "text": "[1] get_current_member\n当前成员：Fffs服务俄方，关系：self。"}, {"id": "431C5322-065B-479E-8972-A6E91DDECC08", "type": "operationalState", "text": "正在使用工具：get_current_member"}, {"id": "0163489B-6DC4-47C8-ACF5-F43873B79D1A", "type": "operationalDescription", "text": "当前成员：Fffs服务俄方，关系：self。"}], "role": "assistant", "kind": "text", "thread_id": "F3F4ED0A-FAFE-43CC-866F-F6A9140FB749", "client_message_id": "54D1C296-A01E-4ED2-B86A-31424666135F", "tombstone": false, "reasoning_expanded": false, "delivery_state": "pending", "reasoning_visibility": "full"}]}
