INFO 2026-04-18 03:09:51,396 accounts.api_io [request_id=964D4596-BB56-4237-B1B2-FC2A675FE1C1] HTTP 请求进入: POST /api/v1/ai/chat/sync/push/ headers={"Host": "localhost:8000", "Content-Type": "application/json", "Accept-Encoding": "gzip, deflate", "User-Agent": "SparkClient/1 CFNetwork/3860.300.31 Darwin/25.3.0", "Connection": "keep-alive", "Accept": "*/*", "Accept-Language": "zh-CN,zh-Hans;q=0.9", "Authorization": "Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJ0b2tlbl90eXBlIjoiYWNjZXNzIiwiZXhwIjoxNzc2NDgyMjUxLCJpYXQiOjE3NzY0ODA0NTEsImp0aSI6Ijg2NDhiMmVlNWRhNjQ3NTA4ZGJjNGY4NzA5NzM5MTVmIiwidXNlcl9pZCI6IjYifQ.Mbzkfwfdxho0BZ5W8N6ZLuoUpGF1oYfGyteV2NPmgrc", "X-Request-Id": "964D4596-BB56-4237-B1B2-FC2A675FE1C1", "Content-Length": "4347"} body={"messages": [{"reasoning_expanded": false, "thread_id": "F3F4ED0A-FAFE-43CC-866F-F6A9140FB749", "created_at": "2026-04-18T03:09:32.277Z", "delivery_state": "pending", "attachments": [{"type": "image", "imageDeliveryModeRaw": "directMultimodal", "fullCacheKey": "AA0F4631-5A1A-4FCE-989B-1D53DBBA7DB4", "url": "https://zhaodkdream.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/SparkClient/20260418/AA0F4631-5A1A-4FCE-989B-1D53DBBA7DB4/%E7%85%A7%E7%89%87%201", "fileMd5": "33d02e489647267757bd7533a1ff4217", "objectKey": "SparkClient/20260418/AA0F4631-5A1A-4FCE-989B-1D53DBBA7DB4/照片 1", "filePath": "SparkClient/20260418/AA0F4631-5A1A-4FCE-989B-1D53DBBA7DB4/照片 1", "storageType": "oss", "originalName": "照片 1", "fileUUID": "AA0F4631-5A1A-4FCE-989B-1D53DBBA7DB4", "id": "33625845-17BD-44D9-9883-3EB39A6C163C", "mimeType": "application/octet-stream", "fileId": 240, "ocrText": "凉*项=为山东省临床检验互认项目，阳谷县人民医院检验报告单\n质评合格，山东HR\n检测项目：甲状腺功能三项\n条码号：226032352250\n名：胡月芳\n病人号：3105737\n标本类型：静脉血清\n标本号：63\n性别：女\n床号：\n病人类型：门诊\n申请医生：张继惠\n龄：50岁\n科室：内分泌肾内科\n诊\n断：水肿\n序\n代码\n项目名称\n结果\n参考区间\n单位\nF13\n* 游离三碘甲状腺原氨酸\n4.97\n3.1-6.8\nPmol/l\n2\nFT4\n* 游离甲状腺素\n15.23\n12-22\npmol/L\n3\nISH\n* 促甲状腺激素\n5.19\n0.27-4.2\nWIU/ml\n备注：标*项目为山东省临床检验互认项目，“太”标识等同于“京津冀鲁HR” 标识\n申请时间：2026-03-23\n08:20\n接收时间：2026-03-23 09:16\n检验者：\n采样时间：2026-03-23\n08:58\n报告时间：2026-03-23\n10:38\n注：本报告仅对所检测标本负责，供临床医生参考！\n第1页共1页\nHht，阳谷且苗河路与黄小路交叉路口\n由任.125-5106177"}], "tombstone": false, "content": "反反复复", "kind": "text", "client_message_id": "41932992-B2C0-46F1-945C-AF7DBFFDB346", "reasoning_visibility": "full", "role": "user"}, {"created_at": "2026-04-18T03:09:51.383Z", "thread_id": "F3F4ED0A-FAFE-43CC-866F-F6A9140FB749", "client_message_id": "1CB615AD-EFED-45B8-9162-A631C0CA888F", "attachments": [{"type": "toolName", "id": "725F1565-679D-4CA3-AE1A-946199AEFFB4", "text": "generate_structured_health_card"}, {"text": "[1] generate_structured_health_card\n【系统】结构化保存卡片正在后台生成中。请直接根据用户消息或对话中的相关原文进行专业解读，无需等待卡片即可继续回答；卡片生成后将显示在本条助手回复下方。若再次调用 generate_structured_health_card：raw_text 必须是你提炼后的医学要点，可选 oss_file_id 与消息中的 oss_file_id 一致，勿把完整 OCR 传给工具。", "id": "B8D9105A-148F-4044-8190-330FFBF10B25", "type": "toolContent"}, {"text": "正在使用工具：generate_structured_health_card", "id": "9292B4F2-2D1D-4096-A4C6-F9086BC5FA29", "type": "operationalState"}, {"text": "【系统】结构化保存卡片正在后台生成中。请直接根据用户消息或对话中的相关原文进行专业解读，无需等待卡片即可继续回答；卡片生成后将显示在本条助手回复下方。若再次调用 generate_structured_health_card：raw_text 必须是你提炼后的医学要点，可选 oss_file_id 与消息中的 oss_file_id 一致，勿把完整 OCR 传给工具。", "id": "7F7A02D2-D32A-46C3-A6EA-66D80E14E8B5", "type": "operationalDescription"}], "tombstone": false, "delivery_state": "pending", "role": "assistant", "content": "我帮您把这份报告里需要关注的内容说的更简单清楚点：\n**核心异常就是：促甲状腺激素（TSH）偏高**\n1. 这项指标高，说明甲状腺分泌甲状腺激素的能力有点不够了，临床上叫「亚临床甲减」\n2. 您本来就是因为水肿去做的检查，而水肿刚好就是甲减最常见的症状之一，这个结果和症状是对得上的\n3. 建议您拿着这份报告去内分泌科就诊，医生一般会根据您的情况，判断是不是需要服用药物来把这个指标调到正常范围，帮您改善水肿的问题\n\n另外其他两项甲状腺相关指标（游离T3、游离T4）都是正常的，不用太担心，尽早找医生看看就可以了~", "reasoning_visibility": "full", "reasoning_expanded": false, "kind": "text"}]}
