INFO 2026-04-18 04:50:15,046 accounts.api_io [request_id=E2A890B9-DF91-47AE-A569-0E12EF7AEBD2] HTTP 响应摘要: GET /api/v1/ai/chat/sync/pull/ status=200 duration_ms=13 bytes=6032 headers={"Content-Type": "application/json", "Vary": "Accept", "Allow": "GET, HEAD, OPTIONS"} body={"code": 0, "msg": "ok", "data": {"cursor": "v2:eyJ0cyI6IjIwMjYtMDQtMThUMDQ6NDU6MzQuMjQwODE4KzAwOjAwIiwiaWQiOiIxMTQzIn0", "messages": [{"thread_id": "015cbc04-6722-4a45-a783-8d25d7bd1750", "role": "user", "kind": "text", "content": "哈哈", "client_message_id": "a9018412-39d2-4b2f-a31a-e2a7c54fab0f", "server_message_id": "2ceb36aa-2192-4be6-bc45-3d8139520df0", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-04-18T04:37:44.718000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-04-18T04:37:58.871918+00:00", "tombstone": false, "attachments": [{"id": "19B971BD-CF26-439B-A342-ED914DEEFE18", "url": "https://zhaodkdream.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/SparkClient/20260418/A747D019-5E0D-4F6A-B3D3-5ECA94B4A291/IMG_1669-D4277935-9541-4D81-BDA1-FB526A45DF6F.jpeg", "text": "凉*顶=为山东省临床检验互认项目，阳谷县人民医院检验报告单\n质评合格，山东HR\n检测项目：甲状腺功能三项\n条码号：226032352250\n名：胡月芳\n病人号：3105737\n标本类型：静脉血清\n标本号：63\n性别：女\n床号：\n病人类型：门诊\n申请医生：张继惠\n龄：50岁\n科室：内分泌肾内科\n诊\n断：水肿\n序\n代码\n项目名称\n结果\n参考区间\n单位\nF13\n* 游离三碘甲状腺原氨酸\n4.97\n3.1-6.8\npmol/l\n2\nFT4\n* 游离甲状腺素\n15.23\n12-22\nPmol/L\n3\nTSH\n* 促甲状腺激素\n5.19\n0.27-4.2\nWIU/ml\n备注：标*项目为山东省临床检验互认项目，“女”标识等同于“京津冀鲁HR” 标识\n-\n申请时间：2026-03-23\n08:20\n接收时间：2026-03-23 09:16\n检验者：\n采样时间：2026-03-23\n08:58\n报告时间：2026-03-23\n10:38\n注：本报告仅对所检测标本负责，供临床医生参考！\n第1页共1页\nHht，阳谷且苗河路与黄小路交叉路口\n由任.1625-5106177", "type": "image", "fileId": 247, "fileMd5": "44f8d8069415467a3e082fe9677ba831", "fullCacheKey": "a747d019-5e0d-4f6a-b3d3-5eca94b4a291/IMG_1669-D4277935-9541-4D81-BDA1-FB526A45DF6F.jpeg"}], "reasoning_content": null, "reasoning_duration_ms": null, "reasoning_expanded": false, "reasoning_visibility": "full"}, {"thread_id": "015cbc04-6722-4a45-a783-8d25d7bd1750", "role": "assistant", "kind": "text", "content": "我看到这是一份**甲状腺功能三项**的检验报告单。让我为您解读一下：\n\n---\n\n## 📋 报告基本信息\n\n| 项目 | 内容 |\n|------|------|\n| 医院 | 阳谷县人民医院 |\n| 姓名 | 胡月芳 |\n| 性别/年龄 | 女 / 50岁 |\n| 科室 | 内分泌肾内科 |\n| 诊断 | 水肿 |\n| 采样时间 | 2026-03-23 |\n\n---\n\n## 🔬 检验结果解读\n\n| 项目 | 结果 | 参考区间 | 状态 |\n|------|------|----------|------|\n| **FT3** (游离三碘甲状腺原氨酸) | 4.97 | 3.1-6.8 pmol/L | ✅ **正常** |\n| **FT4** (游离甲状腺素) | 15.23 | 12-22 pmol/L | ✅ **正常** |\n| **TSH** (促甲状腺激素) | **5.19** | 0.27-4.2 μIU/ml | ⚠️ **偏高** |\n\n---\n\n## 💡 关键提示\n\n**TSH轻度升高**（5.19，参考上限4.2），而FT3、FT4正常，这种情况称为 **\"亚临床甲状腺功能减退\"（亚临床甲减）**。\n\n### 可能的原因：\n- 早期甲状腺功能减退\n- 桥本甲状腺炎（自身免疫性甲状腺炎）\n- 碘摄入异常\n- 药物影响等\n\n### 建议：\n1. **结合症状**：目前有水肿表现，可能与甲状腺功能有关\n2. **进一步检查**：建议查 **甲状腺抗体**（TPOAb、TGAb）和 **甲状腺超声**\n3. **内分泌科就诊**：由医生评估是否需要治疗\n4. **定期复查**：监测TSH变化趋势\n\n---\n\n> ⚠️ **重要提醒**：我是AI助手，以上解读仅供参考。**请务必携带报告单就诊内分泌科医生**，由医生结合完整病史和体格检查给出专业诊断和治疗建议。\n\n您还有其他关于这份报告的问题吗？", "client_message_id": "d2d6388d-e925-4e92-a696-f99ea6558c5b", "server_message_id": "f31fddad-dc68-4c0c-95cf-f0084deefedd", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-04-18T04:37:58.791000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-04-18T04:37:58.879520+00:00", "tombstone": false, "attachments": [], "reasoning_content": null, "reasoning_duration_ms": null, "reasoning_expanded": false, "reasoning_visibility": "full"}, {"thread_id": "015cbc04-6722-4a45-a783-8d25d7bd1750", "role": "user", "kind": "text", "content": "", "client_message_id": "3dcaad09-93d6-4701-bd41-9e0532430d47", "server_message_id": "64d081ce-db8d-49c7-a961-c57405cc80a9", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-04-18T04:45:21.130000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-04-18T04:45:34.229355+00:00", "tombstone": false, "attachments": [{"id": "74E88C2A-DEF8-4B2F-813D-DF77B28511A4", "url": "https://zhaodkdream.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/SparkClient/20260418/BFC24781-78D2-4CEB-8483-51FE030B5776/IMG_0003.jpeg", "type": "image", "fileId": 248, "fileMd5": "402c4ae12709c434aa3e81f05b775efa", "fullCacheKey": "bfc24781-78d2-4ceb-8483-51fe030b5776/IMG_0003.jpeg"}], "reasoning_content": null, "reasoning_duration_ms": null, "reasoning_expanded": false, "reasoning_visibility": "full"}, {"thread_id": "015cbc04-6722-4a45-a783-8d25d7bd1750", "role": "assistant", "kind": "text", "content": "这是一张**风景照片**，展示的是一片**金黄色的油菜花田** 🌼\n\n画面特点：\n- 大片的**黄色油菜花**盛开，形成明亮的花海\n- 远处可以看到**绿色的山丘/丘陵**轮廓\n- 天空呈现**淡蓝色**，带有一些云层\n- 整体氛围**清新自然**，充满春天的气息\n\n这应该是春季户外拍摄的田园风光，油菜花是春季常见的观赏花卉，很多地方会举办油菜花节。照片给人一种宁静、舒适的感觉。\n\n您是想分享这张美景，还是有其他问题呢？ 😊", "client_message_id": "344c8abe-44e0-4659-9b60-671e2e129b57", "server_message_id": "c5a27b2c-59b3-4c03-93a3-60c1fe665a3b", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-04-18T04:45:34.133000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-04-18T04:45:34.240818+00:00", "tombstone": false, "attachments": [], "reasoning_content": null, "reasoning_duration_ms": null, "reasoning_expanded": false, "reasoning_visibility": "full"}], "has_more": false}}
