INFO 2026-04-18 05:00:28,530 accounts.api_io [request_id=C4AD284E-FF09-4518-A436-A6D5AEB0E7F5] HTTP 响应摘要: GET /api/v1/ai/chat/sync/pull/ status=200 duration_ms=15 bytes=1995 headers={"Content-Type": "application/json", "Vary": "Accept", "Allow": "GET, HEAD, OPTIONS"} body={"code": 0, "msg": "ok", "data": {"cursor": "v2:eyJ0cyI6IjIwMjYtMDQtMThUMDQ6NTg6NDMuMTkwMDQ2KzAwOjAwIiwiaWQiOiIxMTQ1In0", "messages": [{"thread_id": "015cbc04-6722-4a45-a783-8d25d7bd1750", "role": "user", "kind": "text", "content": "这是什么花", "client_message_id": "5d744a02-f98f-479b-a420-eec2e6fb38d5", "server_message_id": "6ea4d688-f878-4b84-98c9-d1900b4af8d8", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-04-18T04:58:22.769000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-04-18T04:58:43.180844+00:00", "tombstone": false, "attachments": [{"id": "9DF8D2C7-4C27-4944-8CF2-7E8163B90DDD", "url": "https://zhaodkdream.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/SparkClient/20260418/4B65E442-BB34-45FC-96C0-4352FD935067/IMG_0111.jpeg", "type": "image", "fileId": 249, "fileMd5": "7363f1c787e9e1d8e82db3ebf1376e83", "fullCacheKey": "4b65e442-bb34-45fc-96c0-4352fd935067/IMG_0111.jpeg"}], "reasoning_content": null, "reasoning_duration_ms": null, "reasoning_expanded": false, "reasoning_visibility": "full"}, {"thread_id": "015cbc04-6722-4a45-a783-8d25d7bd1750", "role": "assistant", "kind": "text", "content": "这是一朵**粉色杜鹃花**（也叫映山红）🌸\n\n它的特征：\n- **花瓣**：5片，呈柔和的粉红色，边缘略带波浪\n- **花蕊**：细长的雄蕊从花心伸出，顶端有深色花药\n- **花型**：典型的杜鹃花钟形/漏斗形\n- **叶片**：深绿色，椭圆形，边缘光滑\n\n杜鹃花是中国十大名花之一，春季盛开，花色丰富（红、粉、白、紫等），常见于山地、园林和庭院中。\n\n这朵粉色杜鹃开得正好，非常娇艳！你是在哪里拍到的呢？ 😊", "client_message_id": "c557b5e6-ce97-4e9f-9e20-47526441f491", "server_message_id": "84416451-098f-438f-a3da-9b36b868a6af", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-04-18T04:58:43.124000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-04-18T04:58:43.190046+00:00", "tombstone": false, "attachments": [], "reasoning_content": null, "reasoning_duration_ms": null, "reasoning_expanded": false, "reasoning_visibility": "full"}], "has_more": false}}
