on_ms": null, "reasoning_expanded": false, "reasoning_visibility": "full"}, {"thread_id": "015cbc04-6722-4a45-a783-8d25d7bd1750", "role": "assistant", "kind": "text", "content": "Hello! 👋 \n\n\"See\" 在英语中意思是**\"看/看见\"**。\n\n您是想：\n- **See you**（再见）👋\n- **让我看看什么**？（请上传图片或描述）\n- **用英语交流**？\n- 还是有其他意思？\n\n请告诉我，我很乐意帮助您！😊", "client_message_id": "cdc52727-72d8-428d-bc26-658eeddf44a5", "server_message_id": "022bcc67-ccb7-4e27-89b5-f0c839cb870b", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-04-18T05:07:35.688000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-04-18T05:07:35.837838+00:00", "tombstone": false, "attachments": [], "reasoning_content": null, "reasoning_duration_ms": null, "reasoning_expanded": false, "reasoning_visibility": "full"}], "has_more": false}}
