INFO 2026-04-18 05:46:06,753 accounts.api_io [request_id=D3292009-3FDD-4DCD-8503-B0EBB9D56B90] HTTP 响应摘要: GET /api/v1/ai/chat/sync/pull/ status=200 duration_ms=11 bytes=3418 headers={"Content-Type": "application/json", "Vary": "Accept", "Allow": "GET, HEAD, OPTIONS"} body={"code": 0, "msg": "ok", "data": {"cursor": "v2:eyJ0cyI6IjIwMjYtMDQtMThUMDU6Mzk6MzYuMTU1NzgwKzAwOjAwIiwiaWQiOiIxMTgzIn0", "messages": [{"thread_id": "015cbc04-6722-4a45-a783-8d25d7bd1750", "role": "user", "kind": "text", "content": "共和国v出g个", "client_message_id": "a12955d4-8db8-4a91-9e48-9e46428ad824", "server_message_id": "58f71866-fcaa-4ab5-9435-72b87ef17945", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-04-18T05:39:08.737000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-04-18T05:39:08.744047+00:00", "tombstone": false, "attachments": [], "reasoning_content": null, "reasoning_duration_ms": null, "reasoning_expanded": false, "reasoning_visibility": "full"}, {"thread_id": "015cbc04-6722-4a45-a783-8d25d7bd1750", "role": "assistant", "kind": "text", "content": "您好，\"共和国v出g个\" 看起来是打字时的误触或随机输入。\n\n您是想输入：\n- **\"共和国\"**（与政治/历史相关）？\n- **\"共和国出来一个\"**？\n- **其他内容**？\n\n请重新描述一下，我会尽力帮助您！😊", "client_message_id": "71455897-5952-48e1-bdab-bb5471786317", "server_message_id": "a609e531-53b5-4385-87c0-889467293818", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-04-18T05:39:12.561000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-04-18T05:39:12.553833+00:00", "tombstone": false, "attachments": [], "reasoning_content": null, "reasoning_duration_ms": null, "reasoning_expanded": false, "reasoning_visibility": "full"}, {"thread_id": "015cbc04-6722-4a45-a783-8d25d7bd1750", "role": "user", "kind": "text", "content": "四大石窟", "client_message_id": "fa1e5018-6bb7-47bf-af0c-5dbb74bd75bd", "server_message_id": "e43435c7-4433-4198-884d-612ef61d5ae3", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-04-18T05:39:26.976000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-04-18T05:39:26.957776+00:00", "tombstone": false, "attachments": [], "reasoning_content": null, "reasoning_duration_ms": null, "reasoning_expanded": false, "reasoning_visibility": "full"}, {"thread_id": "015cbc04-6722-4a45-a783-8d25d7bd1750", "role": "assistant", "kind": "text", "content": "中国四大石窟指的是：\n\n1. **莫高窟**（甘肃敦煌）  \n   - 以精美的壁画和雕塑闻名，是世界文化遗产，被誉为\"东方艺术明珠\"\n\n2. **云冈石窟**（山西大同）  \n   - 石刻造像气势宏伟，早期雕刻风格带有明显的西域色彩\n\n3. **龙门石窟**（河南洛阳）  \n   - 保留了大量唐代石窟造像，卢舍那大佛最为著名\n\n4. **麦积山石窟**（甘肃天水）  \n   - 以精美的泥塑艺术著称，山势险峻，风景独特\n\n四大石窟汇集了从公元4世纪到14世纪近千年的佛教艺术精华，代表了中国古代石刻艺术的最高成就。其中莫高窟、云冈、龙门都是世界文化遗产。\n\n您想去哪个石窟旅游，还是对哪个石窟的艺术感兴趣呢？ 😊", "client_message_id": "47d2e078-650d-43c4-880e-96673e54e6d1", "server_message_id": "6cb20592-5da3-4bc3-9a46-7e678e532d4b", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-04-18T05:39:36.177000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-04-18T05:39:36.155780+00:00", "tombstone": false, "attachments": [], "reasoning_content": "用户问四大石窟，我需要先回答中国四大石窟是哪些，然后简单介绍一下每个石窟的位置和特点，这样用户就清楚了。不需要调用工具，因为这是常识性问题，直接回答就行。", "reasoning_duration_ms": 1613, "reasoning_expanded": false, "reasoning_visibility": "full"}], "has_more": false}}
