什么信息呢？比如：\n- 婚纱照的风格分析？\n- 卡通鲸鱼的设计特点？\n- 或者其他问题？", "client_message_id": "bcd7ef46-9b5c-4ca2-a00e-5becd67e4d40", "server_message_id": "04ea0a4d-4f16-4f0e-9b3c-71554b503c45", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-04-18T06:19:44.260000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-04-18T06:19:44.321410+00:00", "tombstone": false, "attachments": [], "reasoning_content": null, "reasoning_duration_ms": null, "reasoning_expanded": false, "reasoning_visibility": "full"}], "has_more": false}}
