INFO 2026-04-18 07:28:47,085 accounts.api_io [request_id=B5B9E5D0-9F05-4332-87D0-F451D42F0CEB] HTTP 请求进入: POST /api/v1/ai/chat/sync/push/ headers={"Host": "172.169.5.114:8000", "Content-Type": "application/json", "Accept-Encoding": "gzip, deflate", "User-Agent": "SparkClient/1 CFNetwork/3860.400.51 Darwin/25.3.0", "Connection": "keep-alive", "Accept": "*/*", "Accept-Language": "zh-CN,zh-Hans;q=0.9", "Authorization": "Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJ0b2tlbl90eXBlIjoiYWNjZXNzIiwiZXhwIjoxNzc2NDk3ODg4LCJpYXQiOjE3NzY0OTYwODgsImp0aSI6IjgwYzNkMmVhOTI2YTQ0ZjRhNmU2NTI0MjMxZGE4Yjc2IiwidXNlcl9pZCI6IjYifQ.vF1TMLa8U3Hzw607OU3sSPxJeLG9z3OxdX0Tn9Cf2zU", "X-Request-Id": "B5B9E5D0-9F05-4332-87D0-F451D42F0CEB", "Content-Length": "1582"} body={"messages": [{"thread_id": "5E1E2087-369F-4C60-8D7E-17319546E39B", "attachments": [], "delivery_state": "pending", "role": "assistant", "reasoning_visibility": "full", "kind": "text", "content": "你好呀！😊 我看到您的胃镜报告了，让我为您解读一下：\n\n---\n\n## 📋 报告摘要\n\n| 项目 | 结果 |\n|------|------|\n| **诊断** | 慢性非萎缩性胃炎伴胆汁反流 |\n| **检查日期** | 2026-02-10 |\n| **检查医院** | 苏州大学附属第四医院（苏州市独墅湖医院）|\n\n---\n\n## 🔍 关键发现解读\n\n**胃体**：见胆汁残留 ➡️ 说明有**胆汁反流**现象\n\n**胃窦**：黏膜红白相间，以红为主 ➡️ 提示**轻度炎症**（非萎缩性，属于较轻微的类型）\n\n其他部位（食管、贲门、胃底、胃角、幽门、十二指肠）均未见明显异常 ✅\n\n---\n\n## 💡 健康建议\n\n1. **饮食调整**\n   - 避免油腻、辛辣、过甜食物\n   - 少食多餐，避免暴饮暴食\n   - 睡前2-3小时不要进食\n\n2. **生活习惯**\n   - 避免饭后立即平躺\n   - 戒烟限酒\n   - 控制体重\n\n3. **用药建议**（请咨询医生）\n   - 可能需要促胃动力药、胃黏膜保护剂或胆汁吸附剂\n\n4. **复查**\n   - 按医嘱服药，如症状持续建议复诊\n\n---\n\n您目前有什么不适症状吗？比如上腹胀、反酸、口苦等？我可以帮您进一步分析或设置用药提醒。", "created_at": "2026-04-18T07:28:47.135Z", "client_message_id": "2BA91044-1C3F-4065-ADB6-5D79C2D45EF2", "reasoning_expanded": false, "tombstone": false}]}
