INFO 2026-04-18 07:31:07,509 accounts.api_io [request_id=7CEFFDF4-95F1-42B9-B37D-2243C4EE9748] HTTP 响应摘要: GET /api/v1/ai/chat/sync/pull/ status=200 duration_ms=12 bytes=12530 headers={"Content-Type": "application/json", "Vary": "Accept", "Allow": "GET, HEAD, OPTIONS"} body={"code": 0, "msg": "ok", "data": {"cursor": "v2:eyJ0cyI6IjIwMjYtMDQtMThUMDc6Mjg6NDcuMTAyNjM3KzAwOjAwIiwiaWQiOiIxMjMyIn0", "messages": [{"thread_id": "5e1e2087-369f-4c60-8d7e-17319546e39b", "role": "user", "kind": "text", "content": "123", "client_message_id": "d7b74d33-b336-45aa-aabd-079de7a49826", "server_message_id": "b2f29221-e5f0-4d7f-a62a-9ea948e2c741", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-04-18T06:28:26.900000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-04-18T06:28:26.958862+00:00", "tombstone": false, "attachments": [], "reasoning_content": null, "reasoning_duration_ms": null, "reasoning_expanded": false, "reasoning_visibility": "full"}, {"thread_id": "5e1e2087-369f-4c60-8d7e-17319546e39b", "role": "assistant", "kind": "text", "content": "您好！您输入了\"123\"，请问您想了解什么信息呢？这个数字可能代表：\n\n1. **血压值**（如 123/80 mmHg）- 想了解血压是否正常？\n2. **血糖值**（如 123 mg/dL）- 想了解血糖水平？\n3. **心率**（123 次/分）- 想了解心率是否正常？\n4. **体重**（123 斤/公斤）- 想了解体重管理建议？\n5. **其他健康指标**？\n\n请提供更多背景信息，我可以为您提供更准确的分析和建议。", "client_message_id": "07c98f65-52e5-4e27-830f-127ddc350fae", "server_message_id": "75df6e43-8853-4a5c-bac0-a83c3433794d", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-04-18T06:28:33.963000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-04-18T06:28:34.171781+00:00", "tombstone": false, "attachments": [], "reasoning_content": null, "reasoning_duration_ms": null, "reasoning_expanded": false, "reasoning_visibility": "full"}, {"thread_id": "5e1e2087-369f-4c60-8d7e-17319546e39b", "role": "user", "kind": "text", "content": "哥哥哥哥", "client_message_id": "ed8610cc-719e-4699-ac0f-ae2c6192b0be", "server_message_id": "bcdbaca2-964a-484b-9767-e229ef6a231a", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-04-18T06:38:54.005000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-04-18T06:38:54.053608+00:00", "tombstone": false, "attachments": [], "reasoning_content": null, "reasoning_duration_ms": null, "reasoning_expanded": false, "reasoning_visibility": "full"}, {"thread_id": "5e1e2087-369f-4c60-8d7e-17319546e39b", "role": "assistant", "kind": "text", "content": "您好！有什么我可以帮您的吗？😊\n\n您是想：\n- 查询健康数据（步数、睡眠、心率等）？\n- 记录饮食或运动？\n- 设置健康提醒？\n- 还是其他问题？\n\n请告诉我具体需求，我很乐意协助您！", "client_message_id": "d4192caf-24f1-4ce3-9eac-9ca08914aa19", "server_message_id": "af559f9f-f103-412e-ac5f-0d61657b7d29", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-04-18T06:38:56.750000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-04-18T06:38:56.736768+00:00", "tombstone": false, "attachments": [], "reasoning_content": null, "reasoning_duration_ms": null, "reasoning_expanded": false, "reasoning_visibility": "full"}, {"thread_id": "5e1e2087-369f-4c60-8d7e-17319546e39b", "role": "user", "kind": "text", "content": "我看我看", "client_message_id": "8496a786-21a0-4fd2-9838-c7d68c490ba3", "server_message_id": "be857334-676d-4356-b779-956d849a7538", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-04-18T06:39:00.651000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-04-18T06:39:00.683736+00:00", "tombstone": false, "attachments": [], "reasoning_content": null, "reasoning_duration_ms": null, "reasoning_expanded": false, "reasoning_visibility": "full"}, {"thread_id": "5e1e2087-369f-4c60-8d7e-17319546e39b", "role": "assistant", "kind": "text", "content": "您好！我看到您说\"我看我看\"，请问您想查看什么呢？我可以帮您：\n\n📊 **健康数据查看**\n- 步数、能量消耗\n- 睡眠质量\n- 心率/血压记录\n- 饮食营养摄入\n\n📅 **日程提醒**\n- 查看日历事件\n- 查看待办提醒\n\n📋 **健康档案**\n- 查看成员健康信息\n- 查看用药记录\n- 查看检查报告\n\n请告诉我具体想查看什么内容，以及需要查看哪个时间段的信息？", "client_message_id": "3b79bebf-75c6-4169-845b-b7c9e52ea72d", "server_message_id": "b3e37a2b-0eb9-479d-981a-ad9ae3f52150", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-04-18T06:39:04.873000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-04-18T06:39:04.855593+00:00", "tombstone": false, "attachments": [], "reasoning_content": null, "reasoning_duration_ms": null, "reasoning_expanded": false, "reasoning_visibility": "full"}, {"thread_id": "5e1e2087-369f-4c60-8d7e-17319546e39b", "role": "user", "kind": "text", "content": "出g", "client_message_id": "32a70ab8-e22d-48c0-b625-a1cb6fbcb999", "server_message_id": "dbded1fa-5c38-431a-b6b2-99ca4696091b", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-04-18T06:39:15.875000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-04-18T06:39:15.845044+00:00", "tombstone": false, "attachments": [], "reasoning_content": null, "reasoning_duration_ms": null, "reasoning_expanded": false, "reasoning_visibility": "full"}, {"thread_id": "5e1e2087-369f-4c60-8d7e-17319546e39b", "role": "assistant", "kind": "text", "content": "您好！\"出g\"可能有几种含义，请问您是指：\n\n1. **出国** - 需要查询目的地的天气、规划行程？\n2. **出柜** - 关于心理健康或家庭沟通的建议？\n3. **出街/出门** - 查询当前位置、周边推荐或路线规划？\n4. **其他含义**？\n\n请补充说明，我可以更好地帮助您！", "client_message_id": "df4e3508-f1a3-4b1f-9cb9-afe33fe23214", "server_message_id": "0c66e874-0ac9-4a63-a8bd-ec0f09b01744", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-04-18T06:39:19.042000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-04-18T06:39:19.012121+00:00", "tombstone": false, "attachments": [], "reasoning_content": null, "reasoning_duration_ms": null, "reasoning_expanded": false, "reasoning_visibility": "full"}, {"thread_id": "5e1e2087-369f-4c60-8d7e-17319546e39b", "role": "user", "kind": "text", "content": "哈哈v", "client_message_id": "b4ba894e-1f7e-47eb-a58c-fe3d337c4bcc", "server_message_id": "0ea28a85-75b1-409f-8ac2-5033860e11f0", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-04-18T06:39:44.883000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-04-18T06:39:44.885349+00:00", "tombstone": false, "attachments": [], "reasoning_content": null, "reasoning_duration_ms": null, "reasoning_expanded": false, "reasoning_visibility": "full"}, {"thread_id": "5e1e2087-369f-4c60-8d7e-17319546e39b", "role": "assistant", "kind": "text", "content": "您好！😄 看到您发送了\"哈哈v\"，看起来心情不错！\n\n有什么我可以帮您的吗？比如：\n\n- 📊 查看今天的健康数据（步数、睡眠等）\n- 🍽️ 记录饮食或查询营养\n- 💊 设置用药提醒\n- 🏃 记录运动\n- 📅 查看日程安排\n\n或者您只是想聊聊天？我都在！", "client_message_id": "cddfd0ba-4c78-4eef-853b-e1765c1f84db", "server_message_id": "b07c8dee-2830-4322-884f-b40e0bf52063", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-04-18T06:39:48.481000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-04-18T06:39:48.469506+00:00", "tombstone": false, "attachments": [], "reasoning_content": null, "reasoning_duration_ms": null, "reasoning_expanded": false, "reasoning_visibility": "full"}, {"thread_id": "5e1e2087-369f-4c60-8d7e-17319546e39b", "role": "assistant", "kind": "text", "content": "很高兴听到您说\"很舒服\"！😊 保持良好的身心状态很重要呢。\n\n请问是什么让您感到舒服呢？\n- 是刚运动完身体舒畅？\n- 睡眠质量好精神饱满？\n- 还是其他方面？\n\n如果方便的话，我可以帮您：\n- 📝 记录这个良好的状态\n- 📊 查看近期的健康趋势\n- 💡 分享一些保持舒适状态的小建议\n\n有什么需要我帮忙的吗？", "client_message_id": "fc733bde-5415-4340-99ec-ec65de4c0f72", "server_message_id": "6e7e2e8c-f95a-4471-817b-a2e598899c67", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-04-18T07:05:32.853000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-04-18T07:05:32.830641+00:00", "tombstone": false, "attachments": [], "reasoning_content": null, "reasoning_duration_ms": null, "reasoning_expanded": false, "reasoning_visibility": "full"}, {"thread_id": "5e1e2087-369f-4c60-8d7e-17319546e39b", "role": "user", "kind": "text", "content": "滚滚滚", "client_message_id": "36ec464c-e69e-4ea8-90c3-235985cbd360", "server_message_id": "81efa155-6319-453d-8989-b4500881d050", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-04-18T07:07:39.938000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-04-18T07:07:40.121890+00:00", "tombstone": false, "attachments": [], "reasoning_content": null, "reasoning_duration_ms": null, "reasoning_expanded": false, "reasoning_visibility": "full"}, {"thread_id": "5e1e2087-369f-4c60-8d7e-17319546e39b", "role": "assistant", "kind": "text", "content": "好的，如果之后有任何健康相关的问题，随时可以找我。祝您一切顺利！", "client_message_id": "2cbd33d2-190a-482f-ab76-b12bdea64e35", "server_message_id": "eb72fa99-c918-4c4d-a69e-daade54d9ace", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-04-18T07:07:42.918000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-04-18T07:07:42.887958+00:00", "tombstone": false, "attachments": [], "reasoning_content": null, "reasoning_duration_ms": null, "reasoning_expanded": false, "reasoning_visibility": "full"}, {"thread_id": "5e1e2087-369f-4c60-8d7e-17319546e39b", "role": "user", "kind": "text", "content": "你好呀", "client_message_id": "51be41bb-902d-49e5-a054-d1f54c5f5033", "server_message_id": "64ab0ee1-6e70-41cd-89de-73331b51d5ae", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-04-18T07:28:27.814000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-04-18T07:28:27.958491+00:00", "tombstone": false, "attachments": [{"id": "E75096FD-349C-4013-ADDC-1F524991554F", "url": "https://zhaodkdream.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/SparkClient/20260418/B8DC2509-1CA7-477C-B9E0-A7AADD4ECEC5/342395b5cd7bf2dad1ea494355711848.pdf", "text": "苏州大学附属第四医院\n苏州市独墅湖医院\n胃镜诊断报告单\n姓名：赵道凯\n性别：男\n年龄：28 岁\n申请科室：消化内科门诊\n门诊号：0000349056\n住院号：\n床号：\n病区：\n检查项目：无痛电子胃镜（不含麻醉费）\n申请单号：260821105\n①食管\n②齿状线\n③胃底\n①胃体\n⑤胃角\n6胃窦\n⑦十二指肠球部\n⑧十二指肠降部\n内镜所见：\n食管：通过顺利，黏膜大致正常；\n贲门：开合佳通畅；\n胃底：黏膜正常；\n胃体：见胆汁残留；\n胃角：光整；\n胃窦：黏膜红白相间，以红沩主；\n幽门：圆，开放好；\n十二指肠球部及所见降部：未见明显异常。\n诊断：\n慢性非萎缩性胃炎伴胆汁反流\n活检部位：\n建议：\n报告医生：\n审核医师：产州的\n报告时间：2026-02-10\n备注：若有病理，请于3-5个工作日后在手机公众号上查询及去一楼或五楼的自助报告机取报告！", "type": "pdf", "fileId": 267, "fileMd5": "98c76af8cdbe6b67f5918596c76803b8", "fullCacheKey": "b8dc2509-1ca7-477c-b9e0-a7aadd4ecec5/342395b5cd7bf2dad1ea494355711848.pdf"}], "reasoning_content": null, "reasoning_duration_ms": null, "reasoning_expanded": false, "reasoning_visibility": "full"}, {"thread_id": "5e1e2087-369f-4c60-8d7e-17319546e39b", "role": "assistant", "kind": "text", "content": "你好呀！😊 我看到您的胃镜报告了，让我为您解读一下：\n\n---\n\n## 📋 报告摘要\n\n| 项目 | 结果 |\n|------|------|\n| **诊断** | 慢性非萎缩性胃炎伴胆汁反流 |\n| **检查日期** | 2026-02-10 |\n| **检查医院** | 苏州大学附属第四医院（苏州市独墅湖医院）|\n\n---\n\n## 🔍 关键发现解读\n\n**胃体**：见胆汁残留 ➡️ 说明有**胆汁反流**现象\n\n**胃窦**：黏膜红白相间，以红为主 ➡️ 提示**轻度炎症**（非萎缩性，属于较轻微的类型）\n\n其他部位（食管、贲门、胃底、胃角、幽门、十二指肠）均未见明显异常 ✅\n\n---\n\n## 💡 健康建议\n\n1. **饮食调整**\n   - 避免油腻、辛辣、过甜食物\n   - 少食多餐，避免暴饮暴食\n   - 睡前2-3小时不要进食\n\n2. **生活习惯**\n   - 避免饭后立即平躺\n   - 戒烟限酒\n   - 控制体重\n\n3. **用药建议**（请咨询医生）\n   - 可能需要促胃动力药、胃黏膜保护剂或胆汁吸附剂\n\n4. **复查**\n   - 按医嘱服药，如症状持续建议复诊\n\n---\n\n您目前有什么不适症状吗？比如上腹胀、反酸、口苦等？我可以帮您进一步分析或设置用药提醒。", "client_message_id": "2ba91044-1c3f-4065-adb6-5d79c2d45ef2", "server_message_id": "9e8ceea5-b2e5-4bde-90f0-d376c14ddf64", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-04-18T07:28:47.135000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-04-18T07:28:47.102637+00:00", "tombstone": false, "attachments": [], "reasoning_content": null, "reasoning_duration_ms": null, "reasoning_expanded": false, "reasoning_visibility": "full"}], "has_more": false}}
