INFO 2026-04-18 07:34:17,408 accounts.api_io [request_id=74BB0B1E-7269-476D-8A62-60CDAA42D414] HTTP 响应摘要: GET /api/v1/ai/chat/sync/pull/ status=200 duration_ms=11 bytes=12298 headers={"Content-Type": "application/json", "Vary": "Accept", "Allow": "GET, HEAD, OPTIONS"} body={"code": 0, "msg": "ok", "data": {"cursor": "v2:eyJ0cyI6IjIwMjYtMDQtMThUMDc6MzM6MjUuMTgyNzcwKzAwOjAwIiwiaWQiOiIxMjM4In0", "messages": [{"thread_id": "104a6e63-1e58-4644-a485-ded9055d9f06", "role": "user", "kind": "text", "content": "帮我根据报告创建 随访任务", "client_message_id": "dc3ef1f2-3fb5-449d-8438-4b753ba146ea", "server_message_id": "81a9956c-71ac-4e00-bab8-ad11135a91d4", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-04-18T07:31:57.560000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-04-18T07:31:57.614345+00:00", "tombstone": false, "attachments": [], "reasoning_content": null, "reasoning_duration_ms": null, "reasoning_expanded": false, "reasoning_visibility": "full"}, {"thread_id": "104a6e63-1e58-4644-a485-ded9055d9f06", "role": "assistant", "kind": "text", "content": "由于涉及敏感医疗信息，系统需要您确认后才能创建任务。我先为您整理一下建议的随访计划，您可以手动添加到提醒事项中：\n\n---\n\n## 📋 建议的随访任务清单\n\n### 1️⃣ 血常规复查（优先级高）\n- **建议时间**：2023年1月22日左右（体检后1-2周）\n- **内容**：复查血常规，关注中性粒细胞、淋巴细胞、血小板是否恢复正常\n- **科室**：内科/体检中心\n- **备注**：如仍异常，需进一步查明原因\n\n---\n\n### 2️⃣ 心内科随访（优先级中）\n- **建议时间**：2023年2月8日前（体检后1个月内）\n- **内容**：评估窦性心动过缓（54次/分）\n- **科室**：心内科\n- **备注**：如有头晕、眼前发黑、乏力等症状，及时就诊；无症状可观察\n\n---\n\n### 3️⃣ 甲状腺彩超复查（优先级低）\n- **建议时间**：2024年1月（一年后）\n- **内容**：复查甲状腺双叶囊肿变化情况\n- **科室**：内分泌科或体检中心\n- **备注**：囊肿较小（3mm），良性可能大，年度随访即可\n\n---\n\n需要我帮您把这些任务写入系统日历/提醒吗？或者您可以告诉我具体想设置哪个任务的提醒时间。", "client_message_id": "b16104df-3bce-44a2-8a41-7c9d54d3ef10", "server_message_id": "9d0847ae-d98e-4a4b-9f6f-1cba5492c4ea", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-04-18T07:32:19.780000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-04-18T07:32:32.687518+00:00", "tombstone": false, "attachments": [{"id": "C3E481B7-8193-4CAE-A906-7A4F8D8CD0FC", "text": "generate_task, query_tasks_by_member", "type": "toolName"}, {"