INFO 2026-04-18 07:48:31,084 accounts.api_io [request_id=6E8EFAEE-8849-483E-91E7-AE2219071F7F] HTTP 响应摘要: GET /api/v1/ai/chat/sync/pull/ status=200 duration_ms=8 bytes=2186 headers={"Content-Type": "application/json", "Vary": "Accept", "Allow": "GET, HEAD, OPTIONS"} body={"code": 0, "msg": "ok", "data": {"cursor": "v2:eyJ0cyI6IjIwMjYtMDQtMTdUMTQ6MTY6MjkuMDAwMDY2KzAwOjAwIiwiaWQiOiIxMTE0In0", "messages": [{"thread_id": "4863d8e4-a8ac-4860-bb1e-ea5293734f3b", "role": "user", "kind": "text", "content": "", "client_message_id": "f3704527-1b2b-4e38-9b73-5e44a809ec2a", "server_message_id": "8082ecd5-7cc4-491a-bd66-48b5976ad9ea", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-04-17T14:16:22.445000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-04-17T14:16:28.990110+00:00", "tombstone": false, "attachments": [{"id": "151FD73E-30EE-437A-8D8F-281D543F3963", "type": "image_url", "payload": {"kind": "image_ref", "version": 1, "image_ref": {"size": 175605, "file_id": 237, "file_md5": "cf30b86e49485b11419dd56d534206f7", "ocr_text": "保存图片", "file_uuid": "737EEB08-DCBF-4754-A4EE-D152C626EB36", "mime_type": "application/octet-stream", "object_key": "SparkClient/20260417/737EEB08-DCBF-4754-A4EE-D152C626EB36/照片 1", "storage_type": "oss", "original_name": "照片 1"}}, "imageDeliveryModeRaw": "directMultimodal"}], "reasoning_content": null, "reasoning_duration_ms": null, "reasoning_expanded": false, "reasoning_visibility": "full"}, {"thread_id": "4863d8e4-a8ac-4860-bb1e-ea5293734f3b", "role": "assistant", "kind": "text", "content": "这是一张可爱的小鲸鱼造型夜灯照片！🐳\n\n这只小鲸鱼夜灯发出柔和的蓝光，造型圆润可爱，带有微笑的表情，非常适合作为床头灯或儿童房装饰。这种柔和的光线有助于营造放松的睡眠氛围，对改善睡眠质量有一定帮助。\n\n如果您想了解更多关于**睡眠健康**或**如何改善睡眠环境**的建议，我很乐意为您提供帮助！比如：\n- 睡前光线对褪黑素分泌的影响\n- 理想的卧室环境设置\n- 改善睡眠质量的小技巧\n\n请问有什么我可以帮您的吗？", "client_message_id": "568f6cd4-bdef-449e-892d-4fb925ab3775", "server_message_id": "a0288c67-1bbe-493d-8636-83ce317f0f0c", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-04-17T14:16:28.958000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-04-17T14:16:29.000066+00:00", "tombs