INFO 2026-04-18 07:48:31,225 accounts.api_io [request_id=27D46150-7E6C-440E-B3A7-3D3C2492CE5D] HTTP 响应摘要: GET /api/v1/ai/chat/sync/pull/ status=200 duration_ms=8 bytes=16575 headers={"Content-Type": "application/json", "Vary": "Accept", "Allow": "GET, HEAD, OPTIONS"} body={"code": 0, "msg": "ok", "data": {"cursor": "v2:eyJ0cyI6IjIwMjYtMDQtMThUMDM6Mjg6MzEuMTcyMTMwKzAwOjAwIiwiaWQiOiIxMTI3In0", "messages": [{"thread_id": "f3f4ed0a-fafe-43cc-866f-f6a9140fb749", "role": "user", "kind": "text", "content": "Hhh", "client_message_id": "bddd4969-ac25-4756-9878-fae23551fbce", "server_message_id": "e19c9249-9cbc-4fde-8609-07a7cb6f0865", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-04-18T02:51:41.504000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-04-18T02:51:53.053616+00:00", "tombstone": false, "attachments": [], "reasoning_content": null, "reasoning_duration_ms": null, "reasoning_expanded": false, "reasoning_visibility": "full"}, {"thread_id": "f3f4ed0a-fafe-43cc-866f-f6a9140fb749", "role": "assistant", "kind": "text", "content": "当前未选择成员，请先选择需要绑定这份报告的成员，我才能帮您生成结构化健康卡片哦。", "client_message_id": "eeff4e6f-08d9-477a-b989-0750eb8879c8", "server_message_id": "920175f7-629a-4589-bdfe-960268994be1", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-04-18T02:51:52.977000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-04-18T02:51:53.062954+00:00", "tombstone": false, "attachments": [{"id": "E373BAD9-6C82-424A-A730-A567B8A43E45", "text": "generate_structured_health_card, get_current_member", "type": "toolName"}, {"id": "9B00EC7A-EB86-488A-8976-95B749ED2E37", "text": "[1] generate_structured_health_card\n未选择成员，无法生成结构化健康卡片。\n\n[2] get_current_member\n当前未选择成员。", "type": "toolContent"}, {"id": "3E4F2152-77DE-429A-914E-905F39E8E14E", "text": "正在使用工具：generate_structured_health_card, get_current_member", "type": "operationalState"}, {"id": "0FB7CF26-78F6-4728-AC19-8455E09D9664", "text": "未选择成员，无法生成结构化健康卡片。\n[2] get_current_member\n当前未选择成员。", "type": "operationalDescription"}], "reasoning_content": null, "reasoning_duration_ms": null, "reasoning_expanded": false, "reasoning_visibility": "full"}, {"thread_id": "f3f4ed0a-fafe-43cc-866f-f6a9140fb749", "role": "user", "kind": "text", "content": "哈哈哈", "client_message_id": "ff611e57-2916-415b-b905-c59945a7335c", "server_message_id": "0bb11b63-6da8-4064-b5cb-dc5ffa71eefc", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-04-18T02:52:14.967000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-04-18T02:52:23.966542+00:00", "tombstone": false, "attachments": [], "reasoning_content": null, "reasoning_duration_ms": null, "reasoning_expanded": false, "reasoning_visibility": "full"}, {"thread_id": "f3f4ed0a-fafe-43cc-866f-f6a9140fb749", "role": "assistant", "kind": "text", "content": "这份是50岁女性的甲状腺功能三项检验报告，结果解读如下：\n1. **游离三碘甲状腺原氨酸（F13）**：4.97Pmol/l，在参考区间3.1-6.8Pmol/l内，结果正常\n2. **游离甲状腺素（FT4）**：15.23pmol/L，在参考区间12-22pmol/L内，结果正常\n3. **促甲状腺激素（ISH）**：5.19WIU/ml，高于参考区间0.27-4.2WIU/ml，结果异常升高\n\n异常结果提示可能存在亚临床甲状腺功能减退，结合报告中“水肿”的临床诊断，符合甲减的常见表现，建议您携报告至内分泌科就诊，由医生结合临床情况评估是否需要干预治疗。\n\n请问我帮您将这份报告生成结构化的检验报告健康卡片保存吗？", "client_message_id": "54d1c296-a01e-4ed2-b86a-31424666135f", "server_message_id": "e191d8cd-60cd-40bb-8555-607e3ca5e6d8", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-04-18T02:52:23.939000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-04-18T02:52:23.978761+00:00", "tombstone": false, "attachments": [{"id": "CB005B1C-A6D7-45F2-B709-D2DF557D5417", "text": "get_current_member", "type": "toolName"}, {"id": "4CB13811-685C-4F90-8C6D-4D509E500969", "text": "[1] get_current_member\n当前成员：Fffs服务俄方，关系：self。", "type": "toolContent"}, {"id": "431C5322-065B-479E-8972-A6E91DDECC08", "text": "正在使用工具：get_current_member", "type": "operationalState"}, {"id": "0163489B-6DC4-47C8-ACF5-F43873B79D1A", "text": "当前成员：Fffs服务俄方，关系：self。", "type": "operationalDescription"}], "reasoning_content": null, "reasoning_duration_ms": null, "reasoning_expanded": false, "reasoning_visibility": "full"}, {"thread_id": "f3f4ed0a-fafe-43cc-866f-f6a9140fb749", "role": "user", "kind": "text", "content": "你好", "client_message_id": "bb716413-79ae-49f5-b1e0-9eee17c30292", "server_message_id": "e7401755-f8f7-4ee6-91d1-9402d88cc008", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-04-18T03:08:35.904000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-04-18T03:08:51.995926+00:00", "tombstone": false, "attachments": [], "reasoning_content": null, "reasoning_duration_ms": null, "reasoning_expanded": false, "reasoning_visibility": "full"}, {"thread_id": "f3f4ed0a-fafe-43cc-866f-f6a9140fb749", "role": "assistant", "kind": "text", "content": "已经帮您把这份甲状腺功能三项的检验报告，生成结构化健康卡片啦，我帮您再梳理一下核心结论：\n\n✅ **正常结果**：游离三碘甲状腺原氨酸（4.97Pmol/l）、游离甲状腺素（15.23pmol/L）都在参考范围内\n\n⚠️ **异常结果**：促甲状腺激素（5.19WIU/ml）高于参考区间（0.27-4.2WIU/ml），提示存在亚临床甲状腺功能减退，和您报告里“水肿”的诊断是符合的，建议尽快到内分泌科找医生进一步评估，判断是否需要药物干预。", "client_message_id": "fe38cd54-dd0b-4c33-9c27-41c924df0f2e", "server_message_id": "a2a0eaeb-ee13-452a-b9ca-e8d04759fdbb", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-04-18T03:08:51.960000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-04-18T03:09:09.667647+00:00", "tombstone": false, "attachments": [{"id": "682EE071-B512-4867-BEF9-9A390A87C9A4", "text": "generate_structured_health_card, get_current_member", "type": "toolName"}, {"id": "07C1447A-E4C8-40DE-B254-F66FCB772C2E", "text": "[1] get_current_member\n当前成员：Fffs服务俄方，关系：self。\n\n[2] generate_structured_health_card\n【系统】结构化保存卡片正在后台生成中。请直接根据用户消息或对话中的相关原文进行专业解读，无需等待卡片即可继续回答；卡片生成后将显示在本条助手回复下方。若再次调用 generate_structured_health_card：raw_text 必须是你提炼后的医学要点，可选 oss_file_id 与消息中的 oss_file_id 一致，勿把完整 OCR 传给工具。", "type": "toolContent"}, {"id": "7C9BDE3B-4EE5-4846-B748-0BDACED0D212", "text": "正在使用工具：generate_structured_health_card, get_current_member", "type": "operationalState"}, {"id": "74AF5149-99C0-407C-8D5B-EDC442686B14", "text": "当前成员：Fffs服务俄方，关系：self。\n[2] generate_structured_health_card\n【系统】结构化保存卡片正在后台生成中。请直接根据用户消息或对话中的相关原文进行专业解读，无需等待卡片即可继续回答；卡片生成后将显示在本条助手回复下方。若再次调用 generate_structured_health_card：raw_text 必须是你提炼后的医学要点，可选 oss_file_id 与消息中的 oss_file_id 一致，勿把完整 OCR 传给工具。", "type": "operationalDescription"}, {"id": "129FB46F-D193-466D-88C0-DF00CEE94960", "text": "{\"prescriptions\":[],\"medicalCases\":[],\"medications\":[],\"examReports\":[{\"ossFileId\":239,\"hospital\":\"阳谷县人民医院\",\"memberID\":21,\"draftJSON\":\"{\\\"category\\\":\\\"laboratory\\\",\\\"content\\\":\\\"姓名：胡月芳，性别：女，年龄：50岁，科室：内分泌肾内科，诊断：水肿，检测项目：甲状腺功能三项，申请时间：2026-03-23，报告时间：2026-03-23\\\",\\\"date\\\":\\\"2026-03-23\\\",\\\"details\\\":[{\\\"category\\\":\\\"甲状腺功能三项\\\",\\\"itemName\\\":\\\"游离三碘甲状腺原氨酸（F13）\\\",\\\"resultValue\\\":\\\"4.97Pmol\\\\\\/l，参考区间3.1-6.8Pmol\\\\\\/l，结果正常\\\",\\\"sortOrder\\\":null,\\\"subCategory\\\":\\\"游离三碘甲状腺原氨酸（F13）\\\"},{\\\"category\\\":\\\"甲状腺功能三项\\\",\\\"itemName\\\":\\\"游离甲状腺素（FT4）\\\",\\\"resultValue\\\":\\\"15.23pmol\\\\\\/L，参考区间12-22pmol\\\\\\/L，结果正常\\\",\\\"sortOrder\\\":null,\\\"subCategory\\\":\\\"游离甲状腺素（FT4）\\\"},{\\\"category\\\":\\\"甲状腺功能三项\\\",\\\"diagnosis\\\":\\\"H\\\",\\\"itemName\\\":\\\"促甲状腺激素（ISH）\\\",\\\"resultValue\\\":\\\"5.19WIU\\\\\\/ml，参考区间0.27-4.2WIU\\\\\\/ml，结果异常升高\\\",\\\"sortOrder\\\":null,\\\"subCategory\\\":\\\"促甲状腺激素（ISH）\\\"}],\\\"hospital\\\":\\\"阳谷县人民医院\\\",\\\"title\\\":\\\"甲状腺功能三项检验报告\\\"}\",\"dateText\":\"2026-03-23\",\"isSaved\":false,\"title\":\"甲状腺功能三项检验报告\",\"id\":\"822DB9B9-4578-4139-8A6C-6DB7330DA109\"}]}", "type": "structured_health_cards"}], "reasoning_content": null, "reasoning_duration_ms": null, "reasoning_expanded": false, "reasoning_visibility": "full"}, {"thread_id": "f3f4ed0a-fafe-43cc-866f-f6a9140fb749", "role": "user", "kind": "text", "content": "什么什么 啊", "client_message_id": "8e85da59-5dad-4dbf-8d7f-3649c440a782", "server_message_id": "2424eb36-de41-4ba0-a8bc-893b64f5877b", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-04-18T03:09:05.891000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-04-18T03:09:09.686839+00:00", "tombstone": false, "attachments": [], "reasoning_content": null, "reasoning_duration_ms": null, "reasoning_expanded": false, "reasoning_visibility": "full"}, {"thread_id": "f3f4ed0a-fafe-43cc-866f-f6a9140fb749", "role": "assistant", "kind": "text", "content": "简单说，这份报告里有一项指标（促甲状腺激素）比正常值高，结合你有水肿的症状，提示可能是甲状腺功能有点不够（亚临床甲减），需要找内分泌科医生看看需不需要吃药调整~\n如果还有不明白的地方，可以告诉我你具体想问哪部分哦", "client_message_id": "443789a7-697f-44a2-8eac-105c3ccb5a63", "server_message_id": "1637e6be-7789-43c7-ac86-7324d4bff286", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-04-18T03:09:09.644000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-04-18T03:09:09.690603+00:00", "tombstone": false, "attachments": [], "reasoning_content": null, "reasoning_duration_ms": null, "reasoning_expanded": false, "reasoning_visibility": "full"}, {"thread_id": "f3f4ed0a-fafe-43cc-866f-f6a9140fb749", "role": "user", "kind": "text", "content": "反反复复", "client_message_id": "41932992-b2c0-46f1-945c-af7dbffdb346", "server_message_id": "4073c9d5-9796-4f59-9f75-cdf82b1bf0ce", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-04-18T03:09:32.277000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-04-18T03:09:51.404433+00:00", "tombstone": false, "attachments": [{"id": "33625845-17BD-44D9-9883-3EB39A6C163C", "url": "https://zhaodkdream.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/SparkClient/20260418/AA0F4631-5A1A-4FCE-989B-1D53DBBA7DB4/%E7%85%A7%E7%89%87%201", "type": "image", "fileId": 240, "fileMd5": "33d02e489647267757bd7533a1ff4217", "ocrText": "凉*项=为山东省临床检验互认项目，阳谷县人民医院检验报告单\n质评合格，山东HR\n检测项目：甲状腺功能三项\n条码号：226032352250\n名：胡月芳\n病人号：3105737\n标本类型：静脉血清\n标本号：63\n性别：女\n床号：\n病人类型：门诊\n申请医生：张继惠\n龄：50岁\n科室：内分泌肾内科\n诊\n断：水肿\n序\n代码\n项目名称\n结果\n参考区间\n单位\nF13\n* 游离三碘甲状腺原氨酸\n4.97\n3.1-6.8\nPmol/l\n2\nFT4\n* 游离甲状腺素\n15.23\n12-22\npmol/L\n3\nISH\n* 促甲状腺激素\n5.19\n0.27-4.2\nWIU/ml\n备注：标*项目为山东省临床检验互认项目，“太”标识等同于“京津冀鲁HR” 标识\n申请时间：2026-03-23\n08:20\n接收时间：2026-03-23 09:16\n检验者：\n采样时间：2026-03-23\n08:58\n报告时间：2026-03-23\n10:38\n注：本报告仅对所检测标本负责，供临床医生参考！\n第1页共1页\nHht，阳谷且苗河路与黄小路交叉路口\n由任.125-5106177", "filePath": "SparkClient/20260418/AA0F4631-5A1A-4FCE-989B-1D53DBBA7DB4/照片 1", "fileUUID": "AA0F4631-5A1A-4FCE-989B-1D53DBBA7DB4", "mimeType": "application/octet-stream", "objectKey": "SparkClient/20260418/AA0F4631-5A1A-4FCE-989B-1D53DBBA7DB4/照片 1", "storageType": "oss", "fullCacheKey": "AA0F4631-5A1A-4FCE-989B-1D53DBBA7DB4", "originalName": "照片 1", "imageDeliveryModeRaw": "directMultimodal"}], "reasoning_content": null, "reasoning_duration_ms": null, "reasoning_expanded": false, "reasoning_visibility": "full"}, {"thread_id": "f3f4ed0a-fafe-43cc-866f-f6a9140fb749", "role": "assistant", "kind": "text", "content": "我帮您把这份报告里需要关注的内容说的更简单清楚点：\n**核心异常就是：促甲状腺激素（TSH）偏高**\n1. 这项指标高，说明甲状腺分泌甲状腺激素的能力有点不够了，临床上叫「亚临床甲减」\n2. 您本来就是因为水肿去做的检查，而水肿刚好就是甲减最常见的症状之一，这个结果和症状是对得上的\n3. 建议您拿着这份报告去内分泌科就诊，医生一般会根据您的情况，判断是不是需要服用药物来把这个指标调到正常范围，帮您改善水肿的问题\n\n另外其他两项甲状腺相关指标（游离T3、游离T4）都是正常的，不用太担心，尽早找医生看看就可以了~", "client_message_id": "1cb615ad-efed-45b8-9162-a631c0ca888f", "server_message_id": "24e806f5-d83d-48fe-8753-7e6c765601b5", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-04-18T03:09:51.383000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-04-18T03:28:31.172130+00:00", "tombstone": false, "attachments": [{"id": "725F1565-679D-4CA3-AE1A-946199AEFFB4", "text": "generate_structured_health_card", "type": "toolName"}, {"id": "B8D9105A-148F-4044-8190-330FFBF10B25", "text": "[1] generate_structured_health_card\n【系统】结构化保存卡片正在后台生成中。请直接根据用户消息或对话中的相关原文进行专业解读，无需等待卡片即可继续回答；卡片生成后将显示在本条助手回复下方。若再次调用 generate_structured_health_card：raw_text 必须是你提炼后的医学要点，可选 oss_file_id 与消息中的 oss_file_id 一致，勿把完整 OCR 传给工具。", "type": "toolContent"}, {"id": "9292B4F2-2D1D-4096-A4C6-F9086BC5FA29", "text": "正在使用工具：generate_structured_health_card", "type": "operationalState"}, {"id": "7F7A02D2-D32A-46C3-A6EA-66D80E14E8B5", "text": "【系统】结构化保存卡片正在后台生成中。请直接根据用户消息或对话中的相关原文进行专业解读，无需等待卡片即可继续回答；卡片生成后将显示在本条助手回复下方。若再次调用 generate_structured_health_card：raw_text 必须是你提炼后的医学要点，可选 oss_file_id 与消息中的 oss_file_id 一致，勿把完整 OCR 传给工具。", "type": "operationalDescription"}, {"id": "EDC09BF3-BD28-419B-8102-C60DC01F14B8", "text": "{\"medications\":[],\"prescriptions\":[],\"examReports\":[{\"draftJSON\":\"{\\\"category\\\":\\\"laboratory\\\",\\\"content\\\":\\\"姓名：胡月芳，性别：女，年龄：50岁，科室：内分泌肾内科，诊断：水肿，检测项目：甲状腺功能三项，申请时间：2026-03-23 08:20，采样时间：2026-03-23 08:58，报告时间：2026-03-23 10:38\\\",\\\"date\\\":\\\"2026-03-23\\\",\\\"details\\\":[{\\\"bodyPart\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"category\\\":\\\"甲状腺功能三项\\\",\\\"diagnosis\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"itemName\\\":\\\"游离三碘甲状腺原氨酸（FT3）\\\",\\\"resultValue\\\":\\\"4.97pmol\\\\\\/l，参考区间3.1-6.8pmol\\\\\\/l，结果正常\\\",\\\"sortOrder\\\":null,\\\"subCategory\\\":\\\"\\\"},{\\\"bodyPart\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"category\\\":\\\"甲状腺功能三项\\\",\\\"diagnosis\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"itemName\\\":\\\"游离甲状腺素（FT4）\\\",\\\"resultValue\\\":\\\"15.23pmol\\\\\\/L，参考区间12-22pmol\\\\\\/L，结果正常\\\",\\\"sortOrder\\\":null,\\\"subCategory\\\":\\\"\\\"},{\\\"bodyPart\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"category\\\":\\\"甲状腺功能三项\\\",\\\"diagnosis\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"itemName\\\":\\\"促甲状腺激素（TSH）\\\",\\\"resultValue\\\":\\\"5.19μIU\\\\\\/ml，参考区间0.27-4.2μIU\\\\\\/ml，结果异常（↑）\\\",\\\"sortOrder\\\":null,\\\"subCategory\\\":\\\"\\\"}],\\\"hospital\\\":\\\"阳谷县人民医院\\\",\\\"title\\\":\\\"甲状腺功能三项检验报告\\\"}\",\"id\":\"7A6BD14E-415F-4507-BEE0-669DFB9A3BBA\",\"dateText\":\"2026-03-23\",\"memberID\":21,\"title\":\"甲状腺功能三项检验报告\",\"hospital\":\"阳谷县人民医院\",\"isSaved\":false}],\"medicalCases\":[]}", "type": "structured_health_cards"}], "reasoning_content": null, "reasoning_duration_ms": null, "reasoning_expanded": false, "reasoning_visibility": "full"}], "has_more": false}}
